# Input

```css
.café, .𐐀, .\ab name, .name\bb {
  café: café;
  existing: 𐐀;
  quoted: "«" '»';
  escaped: \ab \bb \ab name name\bb;
  functions: café(𐐀) \ab name(\bb);
  units: 1café 2𐐀;
  after: red;
}

```


